-- WoW Forever: Chinese quest text (zhTW and zhCN) for quests that showed English on a Chinese client: titles, log text, story,
-- progress and hand-in text, and objective lines, only where our row was missing or still English.
-- Sources: Wowhead's WoW Forever database, Traditional and Simplified Chinese pages (www.wowhead.com/forever/tw/ and /forever/cn/),
-- and for titles and log text Wowhead lacks, QuestieDB's Forever lookups (github.com/Questie/QuestieDB, GPL-3.0). Changed: Wowhead's
-- <name> <race> <class> markers written back as $N $R $C, line breaks as $B, <a/b> as $Ga:b; where our English has $G.
-- Fields with no Chinese source are left out (the client keeps showing English there). Other locales are not touched.
-- Safe to run more than once.
SET NAMES utf8mb4;
